OL,3,GNEWSASchool staff on strike in dispute
OL,4,Aover funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the National Education Union
OL,7,Fat Oasis Academy Immingham are striking
OL,8,Fin a dispute over how funds are being
OL,9,Fused by the school.
OL,11,FThe union claimed there was a lack of
OL,12,Fprogress on a development plan for the
OL,13,Fsecondary school and insufficient
OL,14,Ffunding.
OL,16,FThe academy said students remained its
OL,17,F"absolute priority" and its focus was
OL,18,Fon ensuring they have the support they
OL,19,Fneed to learn and thrive.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
